# basePath Chapter6

::FirstContractOpenCh6
@trigger    OnContractSelectOpen
@cutscene
@once 
{@PAL}      Okay Captain, you now have more contracts available to you. 
{@Player}   P.A.L., what's going on with Kalvis? 
{@PAL}      Don't you mean Cu-6355-29?
{@Player}   There was a mine collapse. 
{@PAL}      My records do not indicate a mine collapse of any kind. 
{@Player}   But Mara said- 
{@PAL}      Mara must be wrong. Misinformation is a dangerous phenomenom plaguing the Ausrine system. 
{@PAL}      Did you know that 92.7% of Independent contractors failed the Frontier Robotics Honesty Test? 
{@PAL}      A true shame that is. 
{@Player}   ...
{@PAL}      Shall we get back to work Captian?
{@Player}   Yeah... sure. 
{@PAL}      Great! As you can see, another contract has been added. 
{@PAL}      This contract requires more advanced materials. 
{@PAL}      It'll require more work, but it'll have a larger payout! 
{@Player}   Good to know. 
{@PAL}      Let's get productive Captain!


::BeforeSupplyChainCh6
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research)
@cutscene 
@once 

//#region Germanium Introduction
{@Xavier}   Hey... uh. What's your name?
{@Player}   Locke. 
{@Xavier}   Locke. Right. Listen, got something for you. 
{@Xavier}   Frontier's been tinkering around with autonomous workforces for a couple years. 
{@Xavier}   And you'll never guess which sector is seeing it's first implementation. 
{@Player}   Yours?
{@Xavier}   You're looking at the first autonomous station owner. 
{@Xavier}   Productivity gonna go through the roof! Our marigins are expected to exceed this next quarter. 
{@Xavier}   And we will be expecting your business.
{@Player}   Wait, so what happened to the workers? 
{@Xavier}   What? The humans? Oh. 
{@Xavier}   We've... reassigned them. 
{@Xavier}   Telling you, the only people needed will be people like us. 
{@Player}   Like us? 
{@Xavier}   Yeah, managers of autonomous workforces. 
{@Xavier}   Corporate's expecting us to up our cooperation percentage. 
{@Xavier}   So don't dissapoint. Expect your business soon. 
//hang up tone
{@Player}   ...does Frontier want to make all fabrication autonomous? 


